B = [
('Atari','North America','1970s-80s','electronics','In the style of Atari, warm retro-futuristic 1970s character. Heavy wedge-shaped forms clad in simulated dark woodgrain vinyl, paired with black ribbed plastic, brushed silver metal trim and crisp raised ridges lined along an edge. Palette is walnut brown, black, silver and cream, with punchy red, orange and purple accents in flat painted artwork. The emblem is a three-prong fan-like symbol with a tall central stroke and two curving side strokes, in white or red on black. Lettering is rounded, wide geometric capitals. Packaging uses black fields, bold red and white graphic blocks and thin spectrum stripes. Cosy, bulky, optimistic and slightly nerdy.'),
('Commodore','North America','1980s','electronics','In the style of Commodore, nerdy cosy 1980s home-tech character. Wide beige and brown-beige moulded plastic with sloped wedge profiles, grey and light brown rectangular detailing, tiny red accent dots and ribbed grooves. A thin rainbow stripe band in red, orange, yellow, green and blue runs under the wordmark, often on a solid black field. The emblem is a bold angular chevron letter shape in white, grey or blue with a red wedge. Lettering is a rounded italic wordmark with a large heavy number beside it. Secondary palette is royal blue with light blue borders and blocky pixel type. Friendly, hobbyist and square.'),
('Sega','East Asia','1990s','electronics','In the style of Sega, edgy fast arcade-bright energy. Glossy black plastic with sharp angular wedges, circular recessed details, moulded ridges and shallow grooves. Cobalt blue is the signature, in wide italic capitals framed inside a bold red or blue horizontal band with a thin white outline. A later softer identity uses off-white and white surfaces with a swirling orange spiral emblem and light, rounded lowercase lettering. Artwork is loud and saturated with bold outlines, hard-edged speed lines, white and orange accents and glowing red or green accent lights. Futuristic, quick, playful and confident.'),
('Hasselblad','Europe','1950s-present','cameras','In the style of Hasselblad, serious, sculptural Scandinavian precision. Cubic square-profiled forms in satin black paint with bright chrome trim, or all-black crinkle texture, sometimes with brushed gold or exposed carbon-weave special editions. Modular blocks that clip together, with deep matte black, graphite grey and silver, accented by tiny engraved white numerals and a single tiny colour mark. The emblem is a small boxed H in white on black, with widely spaced thin capital lettering. Packaging is dark matte boxes with fine foil mark, soft black foam and leather-grain wrapping. Heavy, exact, minimal and engineered.'),
('Fujifilm','East Asia','2010s-present','cameras','In the style of Fujifilm, tactile, classic, clean and understated retro-modern design. Flat-topped compact forms in two-tone silver and black, matte black paint over metal, fine textured black pebbled leatherette and machined aluminium with crisp engraved scales and numerals. Thin red ruler-like labels and small red accents. The wordmark is bold, wide, black capitals with a red flash through one letter, set on white, kraft brown or vivid green fields. Packaging favours kraft cardboard with simple black print and bright green or red colour blocks. Calm, analogue, hands-on and neatly proportioned.'),
('Nikon','East Asia','1960s-80s','cameras','In the style of Nikon, rugged, professional and mechanical. Boxy forms with raised angular humps, in black enamel or silver chrome with finely pebbled leatherette and heavy knurled metal. Deep rubber-ribbed bands and engraved white, orange and green numerals. The identity is a bold yellow square with fine white diagonal light streaks across the upper part and a heavy black capital wordmark sitting in the lower part. Yellow and black stripe accents, bold white capitals on black, and dense, tough, serious finishes made to be used hard. Strong high-contrast pairing of saturated golden yellow and black throughout.'),
('Nokia','Europe','1990s-2000s','electronics','In the style of Nokia, tough, friendly and tactile Nordic design. Chunky rounded candy-bar forms in blue-grey, black, silver or bright interchangeable coloured plastic shells, with soft rubbery texture, smooth pebbled curves and fine seam lines. Green-tinted monochrome pixel graphics with a friendly rounded font and simple icon imagery. The wordmark is bold blue capitals with a clean geometric sans-serif, in a deep corporate blue on white, and sometimes a lighter outline version. Older emblems include a circular stamp with a fish and mountain engraving. Durable, reliable, playful and accessible.'),
('Motorola','North America','1980s-2000s','electronics','In the style of Motorola, bold tech-era and metallic. 1980s forms are huge, cream-grey and chunky with heavy black trim and bright red-orange glowing digit graphics. 2000s forms are razor-thin with brushed aluminium finish, etched flat metal and blue backlit glow. The emblem is a stylised M with two pointed bat-wing peaks, rendered in black on white, white on red, or red on black inside a circle or a square. Lettering is wide, rounded, lowercase or a retro extended capital serif style. Palette is red, white, black, metallic silver and electric blue. Confident, engineered and mid-century industrial.'),
('GoPro','North America','2010s-present','cameras','In the style of GoPro, rugged, active and outdoorsy design. Small matte black and dark grey rubberised cubes with chunky rounded corners, bold white icons, and transparent protective shells. Black plastic frames, folding tab-like joins, orange, yellow or blue rubber accents and chunky round fastener details. Edges are softly bevelled and surfaces carry a fine matte grain. The wordmark is a bold white rounded sans-serif with a small flash of blue, set on black or blue fields. Packaging uses kraft cardboard layers, die-cut sleeves, black window boxes and crisp blue and white graphic bands. Tough, compact, action-ready and cheerful.'),
('Xiaomi','East Asia','2010s-present','electronics','In the style of Xiaomi, clean, affordable-minimal and friendly. Simple matte white plastic or glass forms with softly rounded corners, flat colour surfaces and small circular bumps. An orange squircle emblem with a white stylised mi mark and a light friendly sans-serif wordmark. Palette is white, light grey and warm orange with candy accent colours in violet, pink, lime and sky blue. Graphics use flat colourful icons with soft rounded corners. Packaging is plain kraft brown cardboard with a single small orange square mark, minimal black printing and tidy square layouts. Honest, practical and cheerful.'),
]
